{
  "id": "ep096",
  "duration": 47.985,
  "beats": [
    {
      "start": 0.08,
      "end": 2.868,
      "text": "Astronauts never staged a strike in space.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Za\u0142oga Skylaba SL 4.jpg",
        "credit": "NASA",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Za%C5%82oga_Skylaba_SL_4.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 2.867,
          "kind": "cover",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 2.868,
      "end": 11.113,
      "text": "In November 1973, NASA launched Skylab 4, which was the final crewed mission to America's first space station.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Saturn IB Launch.jpg",
        "credit": "NASA",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Saturn_IB_Launch.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 2.867,
          "end": 11.1,
          "kind": "cover",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 11.113,
      "end": 18.858,
      "text": "The crew of Gerald Carr, Edward Gibson, and William Pogue were all space rookies facing an intense eighty-four-day schedule.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Skylab 3 Close-Up - GPN-2000-001711.jpg",
        "credit": "NASA",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Skylab_3_Close-Up_-_GPN-2000-001711.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 11.1,
          "end": 15.167,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        },
        {
          "start": 15.167,
          "end": 18.867,
          "kind": "detail",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 18.858,
      "end": 26.778,
      "text": "As crushing workloads heavily fatigued the men, an accidental radio error caused them to miss a scheduled daily briefing.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Carr i Pogue..jpg",
        "credit": "NASA",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Carr_i_Pogue..jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 18.867,
          "end": 26.767,
          "kind": "cover",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 26.778,
      "end": 32.298,
      "text": "That oversight resulted in a ninety-minute communications gap with ground control.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "designed card"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 26.767,
          "end": 32.3,
          "kind": "designed",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 32.298,
      "end": 37.493,
      "text": "The media sensationalized this brief accident as a deliberate strike in orbit.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Command Module, Skylab 4 - DPLA - b739724b85f4fdc48c01357d82a87239 (page 2).jpg",
        "credit": "Edward G. Gibson, Gerald P. Carr, North American Rockwell, William Reid Pogue",
        "license": "CC0",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Command_Module,_Skylab_4_-_DPLA_-_b739724b85f4fdc48c01357d82a87239_(page_2).jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 32.3,
          "end": 35.533,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        },
        {
          "start": 35.533,
          "end": 37.5,
          "kind": "detail",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 37.493,
      "end": 43.168,
      "text": "A radio conference soon resolved the scheduling tensions and lightened the workload.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Skylab3-Patch.png",
        "credit": "NASA",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Skylab3-Patch.png"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 37.5,
          "end": 39.867,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        },
        {
          "start": 39.867,
          "end": 43.167,
          "kind": "detail",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 43.168,
      "end": 47.635,
      "text": "Yet despite the rumors, real astronauts never staged a strike in space.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Za\u0142oga Skylaba SL 4.jpg",
        "credit": "NASA",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Za%C5%82oga_Skylaba_SL_4.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 43.167,
          "end": 48.0,
          "kind": "cover",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
